From d215fb6a5d088a54afd5a3607ba47b2da947adf0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jayanth Othayoth <ojayanth@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 00:33:06 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 03/12] event_extensions: Add event extension framework

Add a framework for attaching extension-specific D-Bus
interfaces to log entries.

Introduce the core framework components:
- Request
- Extension
- Registry
- Manager

LogManager owns a single Manager instance that resolves
extension requests and creates runtime extensions.
Extensions are attached to and owned by individual log
entries and receive delete notifications through
Extension::onDelete().

Add builtin extension registration to decouple framework
infrastructure from extension implementations.

No concrete extensions are introduced by this change.
Subsequent commits will add CPER-based extensions.

Add unit tests and update build integration, including
OpenPOWER PEL test configuration changes required for the
new framework.

